{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:01.460Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"むかしむかし、ある小さな村に","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:02.420Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"ひとりの旅人がやってきた。","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:03.680Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"よく来たな、旅の者よ。","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:04.640Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"この村は小さいが、良いところだ。","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:05.600Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"ひとつ頼みを聞いてくれんか？","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:07.060Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"ありがたい！　北の森へ向かってくれ。","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:09.520Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"お兄ちゃん、森は危ないよ。","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
{"at":"2026-11-21T10:00:10.480Z","type":"layoutDiagnostic","text":"薬草を持っていってね。","firstGlyphTop":-1,"clientY":-1,"firstGlyphHeight":-1}
